{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/extras/44d312f7d8c178c38eb00cf68017ebd7.avif?t=1771839626\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/extras_big/44d312f7d8c178c38eb00cf68017ebd7.avif?t=1771839626 width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Plush Shop Simulator \u2014 a cozy shop management game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small city store and grow it into the ultimate plushie paradise. Stock your shelves with adorable plush toys, stationery, and mystery blind boxes. Keep your customers happy, customize your shop, and become the go-to destination for all things soft and squishy!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/extras/1d9d6577ec65f79a1ff21d90c34b0364.avif?t=1771839626\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/extras/b2fc37120029bf01ab6de9ada73dd6ad.poster.avif?t=1771839626\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/extras/b2fc37120029bf01ab6de9ada73dd6ad.webm?t=1771839626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/extras/b2fc37120029bf01ab6de9ada73dd6ad.mp4?t=1771839626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, price, and sell a variety of cute items, from plush toys to notebooks and blind boxes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to Gacha Market trends and scalp blind boxes to sell them at the best value.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set prices that keep customers coming back and buy new licenses for even more variety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire different employees like Janitors, Cashiers, and Stockers to help you around the shop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/extras/0d33f34e21ece46fae1a4dedba10cb9f.avif?t=1771839626\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/extras/883b89cfafcc76a276da3cfcb016ceb2.poster.avif?t=1771839626\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/extras/883b89cfafcc76a276da3cfcb016ceb2.webm?t=1771839626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/extras/883b89cfafcc76a276da3cfcb016ceb2.mp4?t=1771839626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rearrange or paint/customize your shelves. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add decorative furniture including rugs, plants and your own plush toys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design cozy storefront displays to create a space that showcases rare blind-box toys.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/extras/2bed3a8d206cc1b60b3ea6128b48f0de.avif?t=1771839626\" width=616 height=75 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/extras/c4ded0009bfe98d672312fb02efe4da2.poster.avif?t=1771839626\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/extras/c4ded0009bfe98d672312fb02efe4da2.webm?t=1771839626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/extras/c4ded0009bfe98d672312fb02efe4da2.mp4?t=1771839626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new plushie collections, and rare blind boxes as you grow your shop. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your store\u2019s size and unlock a warehouse for even more supply storage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock decor options to attract even more shoppers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress throughout the skill tree for shop upgrades, supplier discounts, and more!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3750820?t=1771839626","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/4eda0134da6a2be7f4c8496067e4daaed0eae769/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771839626","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/c5197a8f598f60db56304c52e2a596877563b91a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771839626","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/c5197a8f598f60db56304c52e2a596877563b91a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771839626","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3902480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/extras/44d312f7d8c178c38eb00cf68017ebd7.avif?t